    "scripts/lib/prospectus/etf_profile.py. Order of 'categories' matters for keyword matching: the first category whose",
    "keyword appears in the fund's name, index description or look-through asset class wins. 'symbols' pins known funds",
    "and wins over keywords. 'sector_etf' null means a broad / multi-sector fund (compared with SPY and QQQ only)."
